    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 8,
      "text": "## ISSUE-1 点「活动」弹窗后，整屏输入被吃掉（假死）—— ✅ 已闭合（2026-10-22 06:04，impl=h0f20e751）"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 9,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 10,
      "text": "**现象**（2026-10-22 05:16:59 起）：点击主场景「活动」后，画面还在动（连拍两帧 md5 不同、右上倒计时在走），"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 11,
      "text": "但点底部「任务」等任何 HUD 无反应；按 BACK 键能弹出「确定要离开游戏吗？」并点得动 → 输入没坏，"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 12,
      "text": "是**场景上面盖了一层吃触摸的 modal**。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 13,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 14,
      "text": "**根因链**（全部有源码行号）："
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 15,
      "text": "1. 点「活动」→ `User.getAllActivity` → 我方回**形状表默认值**（没有 `activityList` 等真实数据）"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 16,
      "text": "2. `onGetAllActivity`（index.js:57446-57459）收尾**无条件**再发一个请求："
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 17,
      "text": "   `RoleOtherInfo.activeObj[0] ? reqSevenDayActive() : reqEveryDayActive()`"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 18,
      "text": "3. 于是发出 `User.getSevenTaskList`（index.js:59622 `REQ_SEVENTASK_EVENT`），我方**没实现** → 通用 ACK `{eRet:1}`"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 19,
      "text": "4. `sevenTaskCallback`（index.js:57387-57405）第一句就是 `if (e.hasOwnProperty(\"taskObj\"))`；"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 20,
      "text": "   我们的 ACK **没有 `taskObj`** → 两个分支都不进 → `HomeActiveUI` 既不打开也不关闭"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 21,
      "text": "5. 那层 modal 留在 popUpLayer 最上面 → 整屏吃触摸 = 假死"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 22,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 23,
      "text": "**现场日志**（`bz_log.jsonl`）："
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 24,
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 25,
      "text": "1792617418233  dispatch User.getAllActivity      → SHAPED（回默认形状）"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 26,
      "text": "1792617418273  dispatch User.getSevenTaskList    → UNKNOWN"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 27,
      "text": "1792617419446  [flow] 公告→destroy（组件无可调用关闭方法）   ← 同一时段的另一个隐患，见 ISSUE-3"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 28,
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 29,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 30,
      "text": "**当时怎么解决的**：备份存档（`_backup\\2026-10-22-0519-pre-restart\\`，md5 `DEC9D1C6…`）→"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 31,
      "text": "用户批准 → `.\\run.ps1 restart`（force-stop + 启动，4 秒 ready，18 秒进 gamescene，新 pid 8576）。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 32,
      "text": "重启后任务面板能正常打开，已确认恢复。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 33,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 34,
      "text": "**已修（最小闭合，2026-10-22）**：新增三个 handler —— getAllActivity 回 {activityList:[],activityShows:[],schoolActivityOpen:0,...}、getSevenTaskList 回 **{eRet:1, taskObj:{}}**（关键：以前没有 \taskObj，客户端 sevenTaskCallback 两个分支都不进）、getActivityCounts 回 {dataArr:{},SevenDaysArr:[]}。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 35,
      "text": "端上验证：日志 dispatch getAllActivity → getSevenTaskList → getActivityCounts 全跑完、**0 条 err/异常**。面板能开能关，但**内容是空的**（活动清单在 \u0007ctive 表 88 行 + \u0007ctive_order 表，还没接）。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 36,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 37,
      "text": "**后续（未做）**："
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 38,
      "text": "- (a) `getSevenTaskList` 回最小可用数据（`{eRet:1, taskObj:{}}`），让回调走\"空\"分支闭合；"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 39,
      "text": "- (b) `getEverydayActive` 回 `{eRet:1, dataArr:[], SevenDaysArr:[]}`，保证 `HomeActiveUI.setData(e)` 有东西可渲染；"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 40,
      "text": "- (c) 更彻底：把 `getAllActivity` 的 `activityList` 用真实活动表填上（要先把活动配置表导出来）。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 41,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 42,
      "text": "**风险**：修不好会从\"卡死\"变成\"打开一个空面板\"，可接受；但 (b) 里 `HomeActiveUI.setData(e)` 的字段需求还没查清。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 43,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 44,
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 45,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 46,
      "text": "## ISSUE-2 穿装备从来没被记账（动作名是错的）—— ✅ 已修（2026-10-22 05:33，impl=ha60c18b1）"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 47,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 48,
      "text": "**事实**："
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 49,
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 50,
      "text": "index.js:59592  PUT_ON_EQUIPMENT:     \"User.equipWeapon\"        ← 客户端穿装备真正发的动作"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 51,
      "text": "index.js:59593  UNLOADING_EQUIP_EVENT:\"User.UnloadingEuipment\"  ← 卸装备（这个名字我们是对的）"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 52,
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 53,
      "text": "我方实现的是 `PutOnEquipment`（`core/bz-rpc-server.js`），**客户端永远不会发这个动作名**。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 54,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 55,
      "text": "**后果**：玩家 05:16:58 装上 `itemID=2302`（槽 5），日志是 `UNKNOWN User.equipWeapon` → 没记账 →"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 56,
      "text": "重启后 `playerEquip={}`、`equipments={}` → **那把武器被\"脱掉\"了**（存档本身没坏，只是这件装备的穿戴状态丢了）。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 57,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 58,
      "text": "**拟定修法（未做）**：把 `PutOnEquipment` 的逻辑抽成内部函数，`equipWeapon` 与 `PutOnEquipment` 都指向它；"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 59,
      "text": "自检加一条 `equip:clientAction`（断言 `equipWeapon` 能记账）。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 60,
      "text": "**建议玩家先别反复穿脱**，修好之前穿了也不会记住。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 61,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 62,
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 63,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 64,
      "text": "## ISSUE-3 flow 关不掉的弹窗是裸 `destroy()`"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 65,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 66,
      "text": "`live/flow.js` 的 `stepNotice` 在组件没有 `onBack/onClose/...` 时直接 `node.destroy()`，"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 67,
      "text": "没走 `PopUpMgr.removePopUp(node)` → 节点没了、管理器里那层还在（正是 ISSUE-1 的残留形态）。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 68,
      "text": "重启前那次日志是 `公告→destroy`，重启后这次是 `公告→onBack()`（走了正常路径）。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 69,
      "text": "**拟定修法（未做）**：兜底顺序改成 `PopUpMgr.removePopUp(node)` → 再退化为 `destroy()`。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 70,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 71,
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 72,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 73,
      "text": "## 附：这次暴露的口径问题（写进交接时要用）"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 74,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 75,
      "text": "- 交接文档 §4.8「装备穿脱契约」里的动作名 `PutOnEquipment` 是**手工调 handler 验证**出来的，"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 76,
      "text": "  不是客户端真实流量 → 以后凡是\"契约\"，必须拿**客户端源码里的常量定义**核对，不能只靠进程内手打。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 77,
      "text": "- 形状表里\"有形状\"不等于\"能撑起 UI\"：`getAllActivity` 有形状条目、回默认值不报错，"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 78,
      "text": "  但 UI 需要真实数据才闭合 —— **UNKNOWN 与 SHAPED 都可能让弹窗卡住**，两者都要看消费端。"
    },
    {
      "file": "F:\\BaoZouyxt\\docs\\OPEN-ISSUES.md",
      "line": 79,
      "text": ""
    },
